#. max 1999 bytes
msgctxt "1"
msgid "Caster's second SG.\n\"Poor Cook\" is not a typographical error.\nIt's simply that Caster thinks she's a \"Poor Cook\";\nshe's actually a \"Good Cook.\"\nThis misunderstanding seems to have happened\nbecause her ideal level of cooking is way too high.\n\nThough she may seem like an uninhibited personality,\nCaster has a very modest and reserved family image.\nShe's has recently been attending cooking classes,\nall for the sake of making delicious meals for her Darling.\n\n             ◆\n\nDuring the Holy Grail War, Caster didn't know basic dishes.\nLove is the Magic that turns a microwave cook-woman\ninto a good wife and wise mother.\n\nWill the day that Caster in a coverall apron\nsay to her Darling \"Here, open wide鷙\" ever come?\nEven if it's 99% impossible,\nI want to believe that dream will come true.\n"
msgstr ""

